<title>USA: New York timecharter fixtures - Nov 20.</title>
<headline>New York timecharter fixtures - Nov 20.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-11-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Ken Pleiades (built 1984) 33,326 dwt del Nopac redel F.East Nov $7,250 daily plus $125,000 bonus Choyang.</p>
<p>Star Peter (built 1974) 52,327 dwt del Hamburg prompt redel Rotterdam $8,300 daily Halgrani.</p>
<p>Mariner Star (built 1995) 65,891 dwt del Cikading 1-10/12 1-10/12 3-5 months $11,500 daily plus $60,000 bonus Shinwa.</p>
<p>-- New York Commodity Desk 212 859-1640</p>
</text>
